    {
      "id": "2c5cb625-875c-41c8-9f51-178b7deb0f7f",
      "title": "Escute e observe a frase em espanhol com apoio de significado.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "c31ba3fb-fef4-4e6d-a7f0-9dd903b47047",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute e observe a frase.</p><p><strong>En mi barrio hay un hospital.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>No meu bairro tem um hospital.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/bd75f3f7f83e4b8b98992ee7f5d0456c_b01-hay-hospital.png?Expires=1794099481&Signature=x6HmYzpFEh2SIUr~3azgvPirxmgRyFAwhnPplLdmXIxQkelsGk0jN~hqAVa4XyA1yznUUHXx5Vlysijy6gZK2V9a6-BLbeZz98RnAE09833tTqoGrJ61LF6kEs4XGka5gvirIyZR0PWSpkgwYt9lFJs~28otWEmhMBK-WMAcRCdu7vMDp~AFq6CkOQWVRaJMoDLLGQAzhqLlXMj6e2Ho6YUNYwKeMKl5g2XLNBeg0sKelVmNn3VyKTL2jOc3cmPCCRkVC~9WroqC0h-27ubScnKTX~fvIONGKBn9kiGGy~iAhtR9xRWvfQmSQowa-dwt-2wfrF3lD~8yaKQKbjmPBQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/db8280654a9a4c7f93c085b9af89f999_b01-hay-hospital.mp3?Expires=1794099481&Signature=teEmWS0joURN29QfomwG68ko6Qm5jLY~cOHAn8cEHvo30D9vIZq--ddeLPRbWpo5vdxteBVEce9NvEd7zdvK52oy2vwdU1OirMWAUR0vFNpgq7MybWqQJLp-Q6l0G9dBcidZVqsosQQvuXAZCXEof6IrAADsP-d1Oi5oIZ3AO~P~aJa6lQqfSElanYu2~oz0i0IjwoySpcp3jj~QTMXk12iDBZ7qIOX2lfeUfm1eDLHIzyY-ZaXeEk3LwMi~pQW1radV5NC7GReACOSeihG~u84lCtyRuec6hLGL4KZ0bYo5CpVvsRnBZ11GzHO10rFwGdIhIgoYMsLrYCSsC0KUeg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
